  {
    question: 'What types of text work best with this analyzer?',
    answer:
      'The analyzer works well with product reviews, social media comments, customer feedback, survey responses, and general opinion text. Longer texts (50+ words) produce more reliable results. Very short texts or highly technical/specialized language may yield less accurate sentiment readings.',
  },
