    question: 'Does the analyzer detect sarcasm or irony?',
    answer:
      'The keyword-based approach has limited ability to detect sarcasm and irony. These linguistic nuances often require more advanced context-aware AI. The tool provides a good directional indicator but may misinterpret sarcastic or ironic statements.',
